  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Months earlier, Fairy Zi Wei used the method Gu Immortal Liang Liang left behind and awakened his final will. With that will, Heavenly Court raised Fixed Immortal Travel to rank seven, collected a lot of Gu worms, and created seven immortal doors. Seven figures appear on a wetland inside Lang Ya blessed land, emanating Central Continent Gu Immortal aura, with Feng Jiu Ge as the leader. Feng Jiu Ge cups his fist to Liang Liang’s damaged will and says they were able to arrive after crossing two regions thanks to senior’s immortal killer move. The will had the appearance of a scholarly teacher; once they arrive it dissipates after reaching its limit, and Gu Immortal Fang Yun Hua names it Senior Liang Liang’s final remaining will. Fairy Zi Wei had used crucial clues to deduce the appearance of Lang Ya blessed land before this arrival.",
      "chapters": [
        1540
      ],
